        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-0" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME — scope&#10;UC-47 / UC-48&#10;Reuse case aggregate and audited financial locks. Staff proposes evidenced outcome; approved Admin decision is a separate reference. Do not&#10;assume incident route has current runtime acceptance.&#10;Constraints/indexes are proposed, not provisioned; no live acceptance claimed." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="810" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-1" value="State / transaction rules&#10;OPEN -&gt; UNDER_REVIEW -&gt; RESOLVED -&gt; CLOSED with current version; evidence/actions append-only.&#10;Staff proposes evidenced outcome; Admin-authorized financial decision reference is separate.&#10;Closing case does not prove refund/transfer; confirmed external outcome and hold release need their own authoritative evidence." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="964" width="1320" height="111" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-2" value="Proposed indexes&#10;{&quot;kind&quot;: 1, &quot;state&quot;: 1, &quot;createdAt&quot;: 1, &quot;_id&quot;: 1} {} — Staff incident queue in cases&#10;{&quot;bookingId&quot;: 1, &quot;financialHold&quot;: 1, &quot;state&quot;: 1} {} — Financial hold reader in cases" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1099" width="1320" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-3" value="commandContract&#10;{&quot;status&quot;: &quot;DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME&quot;, &quot;identity&quot;: &quot;SHA256([actorId,INCIDENT_REPORT|FOLLOW_UP|RESOLVE|CLOSE,caseId,actionKey])&quot;, &quot;storage&quot;:&#10;&quot;Reviewed existing incident adapter integration: unique identity, fingerprint/result with case and hold intent in one transaction.&quot;,&#10;&quot;retry&quot;: &quot;Same action key/payload can replay; external refund acknowledgement must be reconciled separately.&quot;}" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1218" width="1320" height="111" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-4" value="Reference key/type and join rules&#10;_id -&gt; cases._id [String / String]; Extension of existing case identity, not another incident collection.&#10;visitId -&gt; visits._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Resolve under current owner/role/state and transaction guards.&#10;bookingId -&gt; bookings._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Resolve under current owner/role/state and transaction guards.&#10;reportedBy -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Resolve under current owner/role/state and transaction guards.&#10;followUpActions[].actorId -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Resolve under current owner/role/state and transaction guards.&#10;evidenceRefs[].bindingId -&gt; caremediabindings._id [String / String]; Typed private binding and digest under visit/actor scope; durable&#10;incident retention adapter is a release gate.&#10;proposedFinancialDecisionRef -&gt; EXTERNAL_APPROVED_DECISION_ADAPTER.opaque audited decision ID [String / String]; No physical collection join&#10;claimed; resolve immutable approved decision evidence, not a transfer execution.&#10;finalDecisionRef -&gt; EXTERNAL_APPROVED_DECISION_ADAPTER.opaque audited decision ID [String / String]; No physical collection join claimed;&#10;resolve immutable approved decision evidence, not a transfer execution." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1353" width="1320" height="263" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-5" value="Release gates&#10;Incident route composition, case ID compatibility, private evidence retention and immutable decision adapter require review.&#10;Liability/refund policy and decision authority remain approved versioned release gates; no invented amount." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1640" width="1320" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
