        <mxCell id="design-note-0" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME — scope&#10;UC-70&#10;All quantities integer &gt;=0; accepted+rejected=received per line. Record even all-rejected delivery; increment only accepted stock,&#10;deduplicate command/ledger. PR158 is not treated as merged runtime.&#10;Constraints/indexes are proposed, not provisioned; no live acceptance claimed." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="665" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-1" value="State / transaction rules&#10;Receipt, accepted stock increments, ledger IDs and command result commit in one transaction; all-rejected delivery is still recorded.&#10;Validate supplier/product existence and approved stopped/deleted-source handling; stable product order and version/quantity guards avoid&#10;partial/double stock.&#10;Correction creates StockAdjustment referencing original receipt; never edit original receiving history." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="819" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-2" value="Proposed indexes&#10;{&quot;receivedBy&quot;: 1, &quot;idempotencyKey&quot;: 1} {&quot;unique&quot;: true} — Receipt submit replay scope&#10;{&quot;supplierId&quot;: 1, &quot;receivedAt&quot;: -1, &quot;_id&quot;: -1} {} — Supplier receipt history&#10;{&quot;receivedAt&quot;: -1, &quot;_id&quot;: -1} {} — Bounded receiving history" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="973" width="1320" height="111" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-3" value="commandContract&#10;{&quot;status&quot;: &quot;DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME&quot;, &quot;submitIdentity&quot;: [&quot;receivedBy&quot;, &quot;idempotencyKey&quot;], &quot;actionIdentity&quot;:&#10;&quot;SHA256([actorId,operation,aggregateId,actionSpecificKey])&quot;, &quot;fingerprint&quot;: &quot;Canonical operation/resource/expectedVersion/payload SHA256;&#10;changed payload with same identity -&gt;409; same command may return stored allowlisted result after current authorization checks.&quot;,&#10;&quot;atomicity&quot;: &quot;Mutation, source claims/events and immutable command result in one Mongo transaction; no external send/transfer inside it.&#10;Later decisions use separate keys.&quot;, &quot;resultStore&quot;: &quot;Reviewed command-store operation adapter: unique _id, fingerprint, result, createdAt.&#10;New operation is not claimed wired.&quot;, &quot;retry&quot;: &quot;Unknown HTTP acknowledgement retries original key/payload; external outcome needs&#10;authoritative reconciliation.&quot;}" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1108" width="1320" height="187" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-4" value="Reference key/type and join rules&#10;supplierId -&gt; suppliers._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Resolve under current owner/role/state and transaction guards.&#10;receivedBy -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Resolve under current owner/role/state and transaction guards.&#10;lines[].productId -&gt; products._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Resolve under current owner/role/state and transaction guards.&#10;stockLedgerRefs[] -&gt; proposed stockledgerentries._id [String / String]; Exactly committed nonzero accepted RECEIPT events; empty for all-&#10;rejected delivery." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1319" width="1320" height="149" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-5" value="Release gates&#10;Proposed technical line bounds and supplier-status eligibility need review; PR158 existence is not merged/runtime acceptance.&#10;Ledger migration/stock authority and unique indexes require independent transaction/concurrency acceptance." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1492" width="1320" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
