              <mxPoint x="908" y="269" />
              <mxPoint x="908" y="428" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-0" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME — scope&#10;UC-58 / UC-59 / UC-60 / UC-91&#10;Reuse Booking/Visit instead of duplicate booking system. Qualified employee on shift; explicit consent for approved surcharge; final receipt&#10;evidence before hand-back. No unapproved surcharge rate is specified.&#10;Constraints/indexes are proposed, not provisioned; no live acceptance claimed." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="662" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-1" value="State / transaction rules&#10;BOOKED -&gt; RECEIVED -&gt; IN_PROGRESS -&gt; READY -&gt; HANDED_BACK; BOOKED may CANCELLED; RECEIVED/IN_PROGRESS may STOPPED. STOPPED hand-back needs&#10;approved disposition and applicable receipt evidence.&#10;Compare parent Visit.version and grooming.version; mutate extension/event/command result atomically.&#10;Before work: qualified on-shift sitter, occupancy and any surcharge consent. Before hand-back: actual receipt/approved zero-due treatment&#10;and verified handover. No duplicate booking or AI pricing." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="816" width="1320" height="149" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-2" value="Proposed indexes&#10;{&quot;grooming.workState&quot;: 1, &quot;startAt&quot;: 1, &quot;_id&quot;: 1} {} — Operational shop queue in visits&#10;{&quot;grooming.assignedSitterId&quot;: 1, &quot;grooming.workState&quot;: 1, &quot;startAt&quot;: 1} {} — Assigned shop queue; occupancy still needs scheduling guard" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="989" width="1320" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-3" value="commandContract&#10;{&quot;status&quot;: &quot;DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME&quot;, &quot;identity&quot;: &quot;SHA256([actorId,GROOMING_&lt;action&gt;,visitId,actionKey])&quot;, &quot;storage&quot;: &quot;Reviewed&#10;EmployeeScheduleCommand operation extension with unique _id, fingerprint/result; same transaction as guarded parent Visit.&quot;, &quot;guards&quot;:&#10;&quot;Role, parent/extension state and expected versions, qualification/occupancy, consent and receipt evidence.&quot;}" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1108" width="1320" height="111" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-4" value="Reference key/type and join rules&#10;PARENT visits._id -&gt; visits._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Embedded extension in existing visit, not another booking/collection.&#10;receivedBy -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Authorized receiving operator; assigned sitter must be qualified ACTIVE employee, on shift,&#10;occupancy rechecked.&#10;assignedSitterId -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Authorized receiving operator; assigned sitter must be qualified ACTIVE employee, on&#10;shift, occupancy rechecked.&#10;arrivalEvidenceRefs[].bindingId -&gt; caremediabindings._id [String / String]; Private binding/digest belongs to this visit; evidence&#10;writer/retention is not claimed live.&#10;declaredCareSnapshotRef -&gt; visits.snapshots.care digest [String / SHA256 String]; Digest of same visit immutable owner-declared care&#10;snapshot; no foreign collection.&#10;paymentReceiptRef -&gt; payments OR APPROVED_COUNTER_RECEIPT_ADAPTER.typed immutable receipt identity [String / PAYOS ObjectId serialized OR&#10;approved CASH/VIETQR opaque String]; Verified booking/visit allocation and full amount; current payments is PAYOS-only, so CASH/VIETQR&#10;requires reviewed receipt registry/adapter. Browser return is not proof.&#10;customerConsentRef -&gt; EXTERNAL_APPROVED_CONSENT_ADAPTER.opaque consent evidence ID [String / String]; Bind actual Customer, exact proposal&#10;hash and approval time; adapter remains a release gate." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1243" width="1320" height="320" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-5" value="Release gates&#10;Shop transitions and private consent/evidence/receipt adapters require runtime integration review.&#10;Approved surcharge/stop/cancellation/zero-due policies remain release gates; no rate/term invented." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1587" width="1320" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
