        <mxCell id="design-note-0" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME — scope&#10;UC-92 / UC-93&#10;Owner/order/deadline/evidence check; Admin approves same-product exchange or external refund. Faulty goods are never restocked; new&#10;replacement stock is decremented once. Change-of-mind return is excluded.&#10;Constraints/indexes are proposed, not provisioned; no live acceptance claimed." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="696" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-1" value="State / transaction rules&#10;SUBMITTED -&gt; UNDER_REVIEW -&gt; APPROVED_EXCHANGE | APPROVED_REFUND | REJECTED; approved branch -&gt; RESOLVED only on actual outcome evidence.&#10;Per-order source guard/CAS reserves allowed quantities across claims; a multikey unique index cannot enforce quantity capacity.&#10;Faulty units never restock; replacement decrements fresh stock once in exchange transaction. External refund outside transaction; uncertain&#10;outcome stays approved/unresolved for reconciliation, never fabricated as paid." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="850" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-2" value="Proposed indexes&#10;{&quot;customerId&quot;: 1, &quot;idempotencyKey&quot;: 1} {&quot;unique&quot;: true} — Initial faulty-claim submit identity&#10;{&quot;orderId&quot;: 1, &quot;state&quot;: 1, &quot;createdAt&quot;: 1} {} — Concurrent source-quantity review; capacity enforced transactionally&#10;{&quot;replacementOrderRef&quot;: 1} {&quot;unique&quot;: true, &quot;partialFilterExpression&quot;: {&quot;replacementOrderRef&quot;: {&quot;$type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;}}} — Replacement order&#10;cannot resolve multiple claims" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1004" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-3" value="commandContract&#10;{&quot;status&quot;: &quot;DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME&quot;, &quot;submitIdentity&quot;: [&quot;customerId&quot;, &quot;idempotencyKey&quot;], &quot;actionIdentity&quot;:&#10;&quot;SHA256([actorId,operation,aggregateId,actionSpecificKey])&quot;, &quot;fingerprint&quot;: &quot;Canonical operation/resource/expectedVersion/payload SHA256;&#10;changed payload with same identity -&gt;409; same command may return stored allowlisted result after current authorization checks.&quot;,&#10;&quot;atomicity&quot;: &quot;Mutation, source claims/events and immutable command result in one Mongo transaction; no external send/transfer inside it.&#10;Later decisions use separate keys.&quot;, &quot;resultStore&quot;: &quot;Reviewed command-store operation adapter: unique _id, fingerprint, result, createdAt.&#10;New operation is not claimed wired.&quot;, &quot;retry&quot;: &quot;Unknown HTTP acknowledgement retries original key/payload; external outcome needs&#10;authoritative reconciliation.&quot;}" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1158" width="1320" height="187" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-4" value="Reference key/type and join rules&#10;orderId -&gt; productorders._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Check real order owner/purchased line; revalidate current Staff/Admin actor before&#10;decision.&#10;customerId -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Check real order owner/purchased line; revalidate current Staff/Admin actor before decision.&#10;lines[].productId -&gt; products._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Check real order owner/purchased line; revalidate current Staff/Admin actor before&#10;decision.&#10;staffReview.actorId -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Check real order owner/purchased line; revalidate current Staff/Admin actor before&#10;decision.&#10;adminDecision.actorId -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Check real order owner/purchased line; revalidate current Staff/Admin actor before&#10;decision.&#10;evidenceRefs[].bindingId -&gt; PRIVATE_PRODUCT_CLAIM_EVIDENCE_ADAPTER._id [String / String]; Immutable owned private evidence binding/digest;&#10;productphotos does not retain historical blobs.&#10;replacementOrderRef -&gt; productorders._id [String / ObjectId serialized as String]; One confirmed replacement order for approved exchange;&#10;source line mapping immutable.&#10;refundRef -&gt; EXTERNAL_APPROVED_PRODUCT_REFUND_ADAPTER._id [String / String]; Opaque verified external refund resolution; no assumed join to&#10;booking-refunds identity." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1369" width="1320" height="339" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-5" value="Release gates&#10;Approved faulty-goods deadline/eligibility/refund policy and private evidence retention required; no guessed deadline.&#10;Replacement/refund adapters and source capacity claims need reviewed integration; booking refunds are not assumed compatible." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1732" width="1320" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
