        <mxCell id="design-note-0" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME — scope&#10;SRS GBR-42 / JOB-05&#10;Disabled until approved tier names/thresholds/discounts and source rules exist. Only verified paid source joins; no arbitrary rates or&#10;fabricated profile DTO tier.&#10;Constraints/indexes are proposed, not provisioned; no live acceptance claimed." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="730" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-1" value="State / transaction rules&#10;DRAFT -&gt; APPROVED -&gt; SUPERSEDED with expected version/current Admin; no direct DRAFT public tier.&#10;Supersede old approval and approve replacement atomically under customer-period guard; drift in source hash/version conflicts.&#10;Identical customer/policy/period/source hash rerun reads existing assessment, never reapplies spend. Public tier/discount reads APPROVED&#10;only." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="884" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-2" value="Proposed indexes&#10;{&quot;customerId&quot;: 1, &quot;policyVersion&quot;: 1, &quot;periodStart&quot;: 1, &quot;periodEnd&quot;: 1, &quot;receiptSourceHash&quot;: 1} {&quot;unique&quot;: true} — Deduplicate assessment&#10;input/reruns&#10;{&quot;customerId&quot;: 1, &quot;periodStart&quot;: 1, &quot;periodEnd&quot;: 1} {&quot;unique&quot;: true, &quot;partialFilterExpression&quot;: {&quot;state&quot;: &quot;APPROVED&quot;}} — One active approved&#10;assessment per customer/period&#10;{&quot;state&quot;: 1, &quot;createdAt&quot;: 1, &quot;_id&quot;: 1} {} — Bounded review queue" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1038" width="1320" height="149" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-3" value="eventIdentity&#10;{&quot;fields&quot;: [&quot;customerId&quot;, &quot;policyVersion&quot;, &quot;periodStart&quot;, &quot;periodEnd&quot;, &quot;receiptSourceHash&quot;], &quot;atomicity&quot;: &quot;Unique typed input tuple&#10;deduplicates DRAFT; approval/supersession command includes actor/action/assessment/key/expectedVersion in reviewed adapter.&quot;}" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1211" width="1320" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-4" value="Reference key/type and join rules&#10;customerId -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Current Customer; preserve operational role separation.&#10;sourceReceiptRefs[].receiptId -&gt; payments._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Verified receipt and captured version with eligible completed&#10;source/allocation; refund/reconciliation/duplicate exclusion follows approved source rules. Product receipt mapping remains gated.&#10;approvedBy -&gt; users._id [ObjectId / ObjectId]; Current Admin reviewer; automated DRAFT does not self-approve." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1330" width="1320" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="design-note-5" value="Release gates&#10;Explicit approved tier names/thresholds/period/timezone/expiry/discount rates/refund treatment required; feature disabled until then.&#10;Verified source receipt mapping, reproducible source hash, review adapter and public projection need independent release acceptance." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="140" y="1484" width="1320" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>